          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">Lima is the capital and largest city of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peru">Peru</a>, with about 10 million inhabitants, and its historic centre is a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/world-heritage-site">World Heritage Site</a>.</span></div>
